8T11:13:59Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/occult-kranti/ANDOLAN/releases/download/yuga-desktop-finish-2026-10-18/yuga-native-windows-x86_64.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/occult-kranti/ANDOLAN/tarball/yuga-desktop-finish-2026-10-18","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/occult-kranti/ANDOLAN/zipball/yuga-desktop-finish-2026-10-18","body":"# YUGA desktop finish preview\n\nPlay Rama in **Confluence**, an offline three-lane practice world, or **Bow training**. Extract the entire ZIP and run `launch.sh` on Linux or `launch.bat` on Windows.\n\nThis preview improves title and compact-screen layout, keyboard navigation and focus recovery, the world overview and hero heading, loading instructions, delayed-volley feedback, landing contact, crown and sash detail, title lighting and distant paving. Confluence includes local armies, siege units, territory relays, defeat/respawn and day/night lighting.\n\nLMB draws and shoots; Q/E/C/X use Rama's four abilities; R reloads; F/G fly and grapple; F2 opens Help/remapping; F3 opens the ability guide; Escape pauses. Saved bindings replace these defaults.\n\nThe package source is `96d5b9cd3114b9732f7dc80433b1ca0a1d4a9b12`. Its native CI passed all 37 steps. Linux uses an explicitly declared public Godot 4.6.3 template with one pipeline-scheduling patch; export uses the official editor. Engine source, patch, build and license provenance are included in the Linux ZIP. The manifests and `SHA256SUMS.txt` identify the exact files.\n\nThe exact Linux archive completed warm and independent fresh-user cold native-input routes in 263.645 and 305.551 seconds on the software-rendered cloud. All 59 original screens were independently reviewed. Settings/remapping, both practice entries, film return, hero heading, overview hold/resume and native Quit passed; outcome fixtures are explicitly staged.\n\nThis is an offline development preview. Windows has archive validation but has not been executed in this Linux workspace. Software-rendered cloud tests do not establish physical-GPU performance or human listening/playtest quality. Whole-hero sculpting, sustained locomotion, world and unit art, native online matches and the complete roster remain in development. The Deadlock-level graphics and animation target remains open.\n"}